WEBVTT

00:11:28.716 --> 00:11:31.956
And I’m like, there’s no way,
I couldn’t even imagine my future.

00:11:31.956 --> 00:11:34.036
I couldn't imagine
living to the age of 40.

00:11:34.076 --> 00:11:35.636
I thought I would be dead by 35.

00:11:35.636 --> 00:11:37.756
I’m being honest
with anyone who’s listening.

00:11:37.756 --> 00:11:41.276
My timeline, you know, I imagine a lot,
like I said, like Doctor Strange,

00:11:41.316 --> 00:11:43.316
it ended at 35,
I just couldn't imagine it.

00:11:43.356 --> 00:11:44.956
And I just knew that I would die.

00:11:44.996 --> 00:11:46.716
It’d be over, and I almost did die.

00:11:46.756 --> 00:11:48.916
But here I am, sitting in my home,

00:11:48.956 --> 00:11:51.196
married to a woman
who's way better than me,

00:11:51.236 --> 00:11:52.476
I married way up.

00:11:52.516 --> 00:11:54.356
Like, hotter than me, smarter than me,

00:11:54.396 --> 00:11:56.316
like, it’s ridiculous, not even cool.

00:11:56.316 --> 00:11:59.516
And then I got three kids
and then Nusayba, who was supposed to die,

00:11:59.556 --> 00:12:01.756
that’s what they told me,
she wouldn’t make it.